Vehicle oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-11-05. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Exports the static CheckForAndHandleHandleVehicleInteractiveClick of Turn_Based_Input.cc as
OracleVehicleInteractiveClick, so the vehicle probes run the hand and move cursor click on a vehicle with gUIFullTarget
set, and marks three cosmetic Random draws 4001/4000 in the trace of 0002: the passenger who speaks a vehicle's battle
sound (PickRandomPassengerFromVehicle), the footstep variant (InternalPlaySoldierFootstepSound) and the blood pool
graphic (UpdateBloodGraphics), which ja2-node leaves to the client (deviations "Footstep variants", "Cosmetic draws in
attacks"). No behaviour change. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0027.

--- a/src/game/Tactical/Soldier_Control.cc
+++ b/src/game/Tactical/Soldier_Control.cc
@@ -8856,11 +8856,13 @@
 
 	// Pick a random sound
 	UINT8 random_snd;
+	OracleTraceMark(ORACLE_MARK_COSMETIC_BEGIN);
 	do
 	{
 		random_snd = Random(random_max);
 	}
 	while (random_snd == s->ubLastFootPrintSound);
+	OracleTraceMark(ORACLE_MARK_COSMETIC_END);
 
 	s->ubLastFootPrintSound = random_snd;
 
